        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa okule piny i lowo piyo aka olamo Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa owaco ni, “Rwoth, k'adieri iwinjo kodan maber, akwayin ikadhi gi wan. Ji me wiy gin tek, to cwaki raco gi reco mawan, aka iyey wan paka ji perin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rwoth cewo cikirok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Onyo atimo cikirok gi Joisiraili. I waŋ jo abino timo gigipiny madongo nger mafodi akitimo kamoro je i piny i dier nonin je. Ji je jobino neno gigipiny madongo ma An Rwoth, anyalo timo, rupiri akidho timo gima kiwacere riwin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw win or m'amiyo win konon me. Neni, abino riemo woko Joamor, Jokanan, Johiti, Joperiz, Johivi, kodi Joyebus ruwaŋ win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri witim cikirok gi ji ma piny ma wicegin kidh'iye, rupiri me nyalo bedo riwan bwo ma tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 16:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwanyowoko, tur win migam pajo, nyek win sirin pajo, aka witoŋ piny cal ma were madhako pajo Asera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
